{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# codemap-view, components\nThe app's modules under `src/`. Arrows point from caller to callee. Neighbours from the root map are dashed weak links.","x":-304,"y":-555,"width":300,"height":160},
		{"id":"wl-person","type":"file","file":"root.canvas","subpath":"#person-dev","x":-546,"y":-77,"width":300,"height":160},
		{"id":"wl-target","type":"file","file":"root.canvas","subpath":"#ext-target","x":-550,"y":225,"width":300,"height":160},
		{"id":"wl-glfw","type":"file","file":"root.canvas","subpath":"#ext-glfw","x":-543,"y":-282,"width":300,"height":160},
		{"id":"wl-project","type":"file","file":"root.canvas","subpath":"#store-project","x":1151,"y":-34,"width":300,"height":203},
		{"id":"wl-cache","type":"file","file":"root.canvas","subpath":"#store-cache","x":1471,"y":124,"width":310,"height":222},
		{"id":"wl-treesitter","type":"file","file":"root.canvas","subpath":"#ext-treesitter","x":168,"y":825,"width":311,"height":198},
		{"id":"cmp-render","type":"text","text":"## Render & UI\n*Component: C, OpenGL 3 + Nuklear*\n`main.c` owns the window and frame loop, switching between the canvas view and the 3D explorer. Also: 3D layout, camera, picking, labels, side panels (the Inspector shows file text, stats and notes), note composer, theme, embedded fonts.\nKey: `main.c`, `canvas_view.c`, `layout3d.c`, `gl_scene.c`, `project_build.c`, `properties_panel.c`\nCode: [[../src/render]]","x":101,"y":-328,"width":300,"height":251,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"cmp-canvas","type":"text","text":"## Canvas model & export\n*Component: C*\nJSON Canvas load/save that round-trips the spec, `project.json` handling, a project-wide index for search and weak links, and Markdown Manual / LLM Brief export.\nKey: `canvas_doc.c`, `project.c`, `canvas_index.c`, `export.c`\nCode: [[../src/canvas]]","x":715,"y":-322,"width":302,"height":238,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"cmp-notes","type":"text","text":"## Notes & overlays\n*Component: C*\nFile, line and group notes in `graph.notes.md`; dragged node positions in `graph.overlay.json`. FNV-1a content hashes flag notes whose file changed.\nKey: `notes.c`, `overlay.c`, `filehash.c`\nCode: [[../src/notes]]","x":1474,"y":-300,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"cmp-pipeline","type":"text","text":"## Graph build pipeline\n*Component: C*\n`build_graph()` walks the roots, parses every file an adapter claims, then resolves references in two passes (declarations into a symbol table, then lookups) then works out per-file stats (lines, indentation, complexity, fan-in/out, cycles, blast radius, git churn, hotspots) and writes `graph.json`. Runs on a worker thread; not reentrant.\nKey: `build_graph.c`, `walk.c`, `parse.c`, `resolve.c`, `filestats.c`, `graphstats.c`, `gitstats.c`\nCode: [[../src/pipeline]]","x":-100,"y":192,"width":301,"height":270,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"cmp-lang","type":"text","text":"## Language adapters\n*Component: C, tree-sitter*\nOne `LanguageAdapter` per language (extract declarations, extract references, resolve). The pipeline only sees the interface, never a language by name.\nKey: `adapter.h`, `registry.c`\nInside: [[app-lang.canvas]]","x":-189,"y":580,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"cmp-graph","type":"text","text":"## Graph model\n*Component: C*\nIn-memory node/edge graph and its networkx node-link JSON writer/reader.\nKey: `graph.c`, `graph_json.c`\nCode: [[../src/graph]]","x":810,"y":133,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"cmp-common","type":"text","text":"## Common utilities\n*Component: C*\nCode-cache folder naming (shared by build and export), path helpers and the walker's skip list, the string to file-id symbol table, and a one-shot pthreads/Win32 worker thread.\nKey: `code_cache.c`, `pathutil.c`, `symtab.c`, `thread.c`\nCode: [[../src/common]]","x":-552,"y":576,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"cmp-vendor","type":"text","text":"## Vendored libraries\n*Component: copied-in third-party code*\nNuklear (+ GLFW/GL3 backend), tinyfiledialogs (native open/save dialogs), `json.h`, GLAD (non-Apple GL loader), Inter and JetBrains Mono fonts (embedded at build time).\nCode: [[../vendor]]","x":298,"y":194,"width":300,"height":200,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"wl-git","type":"file","file":"root.canvas","subpath":"#ext-git","x":-550,"y":400,"width":300,"height":160}
	],
